+   define buffer buf_clients for ub.clients .
+   
+   ASSIGN FRAME {&FRAME-NAME} {&DISPLAYED-OBJECTS}.
+/*=============
+display dop-info sec-fields with frame {&frame-name} .
+hide dop-info sec-fields in frame {&frame-name} .
